{"id":"wb-7-1229","name":"慈氏塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"慈氏塔","text":"慈氏塔又名慈氏寺塔，位于湖南省岳阳市岳阳楼区塔前街。现存为宋朝孟珙主持重建，为湖南最早的古塔遗存之一。1956年被列为湖南省重点文物保护单位，2013年3月被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%85%88%E6%B0%8F%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86856379,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856379","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/06990b8617e4fd9ac3d554b2.jpg","title":"20240720-慈氏塔-望向洞庭湖.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240720-%E6%85%88%E6%B0%8F%E5%A1%94-%E6%9C%9B%E5%90%91%E6%B4%9E%E5%BA%AD%E6%B9%96.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/20240720-%E6%85%88%E6%B0%8F%E5%A1%94-%E6%9C%9B%E5%90%91%E6%B4%9E%E5%BA%AD%E6%B9%96.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Saigyouji-Noriko","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​慈氏塔-望向洞庭湖","width":320,"height":213}}